9 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63-67 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>107 cm / 42.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>107 cm / 42.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>63-70 kg / 139-154 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65-69 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Ivory Ruffle Mommy and Me Dresses are made for sunlit getaways, family photos, and slow summer afternoons. The lightweight woven fabric keeps the look airy, while the softly gathered neckline and cascading ruffle tiers give both mom and mini an easy, floaty silhouette that moves beautifully with every step.</p>\n\n<p>From beach walks to birthday brunches, this sleeveless matching dress set feels polished without losing its playful charm. The solid ivory color keeps styling simple, and the roomy tiered cut pairs just as easily with sandals and bows as it does with woven bags and vacation snapshots.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy woven feel:</strong> Lightweight polyester keeps the silhouette easy and warm-weather friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft gathered neckline:</strong> A smooth round neckline adds polish while keeping the fit relaxed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Layered ruffle tiers:</strong> Cascading panels create volume, movement, and a twirl-friendly finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Breezy sleeveless cut:</strong> An easy shape that styles well for travel, parties, and everyday sunny plans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home an ivory matching dress set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Child 1-2yr","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dresses","Girl Dress","https://detail.16